      "first": {
        "speaker": 26,
        "line": 3,
        "text": "You will be lonely. You will howl like a dog as you walk alone. You will carry dog shit cupped in your hands. You will be smeared with dog shit. Your spirit will wane and dwindle to blue, the colour of despair..."
